    "updated_at": "2015-04-25T12:32:26Z",
    "body": "[Fixed](https://github.com/tobie/specref/commit/5814cf3) the [UI-EVENTS] Specref bug by aliasing [UI-EVENTS] to [UIEVENTS].\n\nIn Specref:\n- [CSSOM-VIEW]  [exists](http://www.specref.org/?q=CSSOM-VIEW) and has an ED that points to http://dev.w3.org/csswg/cssom-view/\n- [CSSOM-VIEW-1] doesn't exist as it's not on w3.org/TR/ yet, so isn't automatically generated (or aliased to [CSSOM-VIEW]). You can either add it manually through a PR or wait until it's published on TR/, at which point it'll be automatically aliased.\n- [SELECTOR-4] [exists](http://www.specref.org/?q=SELECTORS4) but doesn't have an ED. That can be fixed manually (and I think shouldn't be overwritten by the auto-update script unless said script has a bug I'll need to fix).\n- [SELECTOR4] doesn't exist, and could be added through a simple alias if need be (PR welcome).\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
